---
const QUESTIONS = [
  {
    q: 'Are we locked in?',
    a: 'It deploys plain CloudFormation stacks into your account, and the config lives in your repo. stacktape synth writes the template.'
  },
  {
    q: 'What if Stacktape disappears?',
    a: 'The CLI is open source (MIT) and deploys with your own AWS credentials. You would lose the Console: history, monitoring, incidents and costs.'
  },
  {
    q: 'What does the Console see?',
    a: 'Error events, metrics, check results and security findings. Application logs, build artifacts and secrets stay in your account.'
  },
  {
    q: 'What does it cost?',
    a: 'AWS bills you at AWS prices. Stacktape is free up to $200 a month of AWS spend, then 19–25% of it. Never per seat.'
  },
  {
    q: 'What if we need something it doesn’t support?',
    a: 'Overrides, raw CloudFormation and AWS CDK constructs deploy in the same stack.'
  },
  {
    q: 'What if a release breaks production?',
    a: 'One command redeploys a stored earlier release without a rebuild. It doesn’t roll back by itself.'
  }
];
---

<section class="b-questions" aria-labelledby="b-questions-title">
  <div class="b-questions__head">
    <h2 id="b-questions-title">Before you bet on it</h2>
    <p>What CTOs ask us first.</p>
  </div>
  <dl class="b-questions__list">
    {
      QUESTIONS.map((item) => (
        <div>
          <dt>{item.q}</dt>
          <dd>{item.a}</dd>
        </div>
      ))
    }
  </dl>
</section>

<style>
  .b-questions {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(14rem, 17rem) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: var(--brand-space-6) clamp(2rem, 1rem + 2.5vw, 4rem);
    width: var(--b-width);
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding-block: clamp(4rem, 2.5rem + 4vw, 8rem);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--brand-border);
  }

  h2 {
    font: var(--brand-weight-heading) var(--brand-type-title) / 1.15 var(--brand-font-heading);
    letter-spacing: var(--brand-tracking-heading);
  }

  .b-questions__head p {
    margin-top: var(--brand-space-2);
    color: var(--brand-muted);
    font-size: var(--brand-type-sm);
  }

  .b-questions__list {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: var(--brand-space-6) clamp(2rem, 1rem + 3vw, 5rem);
    margin: 0;
  }

  dt {
    margin-bottom: var(--brand-space-2);
    font: var(--brand-weight-label) var(--brand-type-lead) / 1.3 var(--brand-font-heading);
  }

  dd {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--brand-muted);
  }

  @media (max-width: 64rem) {
    .b-questions,
    .b-questions__list {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
  }
</style>
